{{Term/Store|Sizzlefin Trout|Sizzlefin Trouts|Series, BotW, TotK, AoC, AoI|plural}} are recurring [[Creature]]s and [[Item]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Inventory"/><ref name="AoC Material"/><ref name="AoI Materials"/>

==Characteristics==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Compendium/Extract|Sizzlefin Trout}}
Sizzlefin Trouts can be found swimming in [[Hot Spring]]s in the [[Eldin Canyon]] and [[Eldin Mountains]]. They are also sold at the [[Coral Reef]] in [[Zora's Domain]] by [[Cleff]]. It has a special organ that stores heat, which will grant [[Cold Resistance]] to [[Link]] when [[Cooking|Cooked]] into a [[Meal]].<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> Eating one raw restores one of Link's [[Heart]]s, but it can be exposed to [[Fire]] to make [[Roasted Trout]] or chilled by [[Ice]] to make [[Frozen Trout]].

